                "value": "Released to Public ID: DNSC8802245 Service Depicted:  Command Shown: N1601 Reflagged Kuwaiti tankers move through Persian Gulf waters escorted by U.S. Navy ships. The convoy includes, from front to back: the GAS KING, OCEAN CITY, SEA ISLE CITY, and BRIDGETON. U.S. Navy ships are serving as protection against possible attack from hostile forces until the tankers reach open waters. Camera Operator: PH2 TOLLIVER  Date Shot: 22 Aug 1987",
